| `/ai-triage` | `AITriagePage` | `AIProblemManagement` |
| `/university` | `UniversityPage` | `UniversityModule` |
| `/industry` | `IndustryPage` | `IndustryModule` |
| `/lifecycle` | `LifecyclePage` | `ProjectLifecycleView` |
| `/analytics` | `AnalyticsPage` | `AnalyticsDashboard` |
