  - Home page card clicks navigate to correct routes.
  - Browser back/forward buttons work.
  - All data loading (problems, analytics, etc.) works across pages.
  - Notification panel, problem details modal, and communication FAB work on every page.
  - Language toggle persists across navigation.
  - Submit challenge flow works end-to-end (submit → redirects to challenges page).
